ft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99965","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99965.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99965.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-11T23:41:07Z"},"body":"The v1 version is deprecated and bound to be removed in the future from all compositors. This patch adds a v1/v2 designator to everything related to the protocol and prefers the v2 protocol if both are available.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, renames the event handler to follow the Wayland interface name, for consistency with the rest of the codebase.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nShould I wrap the deprecated protocols into the deprecated header? I don't think but it's worth pointing that out.\r\n\r\nAlso note that I added a lot of \"deprecated\" comments, no idea if that's excessive; feedback is welcome.\r\n\r\nI tested the thing and it seems to work, although I'm not really sure how to check it properly. `dbus-monitor` looks fine and we indeed get a handle so I'm quite sure it works.\r\n\r\ncc @bruvgz as they implemented the protocol originally.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://